		KeyFile:  keyPath,
		CAFile:   caPath,
	})
	require.NoError(t, err)
	require.Equal(t, mtls.ModeMTLS, mode)

	// credentials.NewTLS doesn't expose its inner *tls.Config, but
	// ServerHandshake's behavior is what we're really asserting: a
	// RequireAndVerifyClientCert config rejects the handshake when
	// the client offers no cert. The integration-level mTLS test
	// (services/identity-svc/tests/integration/mtls_test.go) covers
	// that end-to-end; here we just confirm the helper produced a
